{"h":"\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #0B2A4A; background: #FFFFFF; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden\">\n\n\n<!-- hero -->\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #DDF0FF 0%, #FFFFFF 100%)\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 32px 36px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #0A6CC2; margin-bottom: 16px\"><span class=\"live\" style=\"color: #1F8A4C\">●</span> TRADE DESK · EVERY WEEKDAY</div>\n<h1 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 92px); line-height: 0.96; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 18px; max-width: 1100px\">What changed in trade, <span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">and what it means for your cargo.</span></h1>\n<p style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.55; color: #17436B; max-width: 760px; margin: 0\">Customs updates, route changes and plain-language guides from people who clear cargo every day. No jargon, no fluff.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- featured -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 32px 0\">\n<a href=\"mobile-phone-exports.html\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; border-radius: 28px; overflow: hidden; background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1.2 1 520px; min-width: 0; min-height: 340px; background: #BFE5FF url('bom-poster.jpg') center / cover\"></div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; padding: 44px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; justify-content: center\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center\"><span style=\"background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A; border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 12px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-size: 11px\">MOBILE EXPORTS</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-size: 11px; color: #BFE5FF\">FEATURED</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(30px, 3vw, 44px); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.02em\">Smartphone exports hit a record $9.84bn in one quarter</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #DCEEFC\">April to June 2026 was the best quarter yet for Indian phones abroad. What it means for air capacity out of Mumbai this peak season, and how to book ahead.</div>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 600; color: #FFC93C\">Read the brief →</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n\n<!-- filters + grid -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 32px 90px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px 28px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 26px\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 48px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0\">Latest from the desk</h2>\n<div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Topic\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{tabs}}\" as=\"t\" hint-placeholder-count=\"7\">\n<button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"{{t.on}}\" onClick=\"{{t.pick}}\" style=\"{{t.style}}\">{{t.label}}</button>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 16px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{items}}\" as=\"i\" hint-placeholder-count=\"9\">\n<a href=\"#\" class=\"card\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: inherit; background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 22px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; align-items: center\"><span style=\"{{i.tagStyle}}\">{{i.tag}}</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5E7891\">{{i.kind}}</span></div>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 106%; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.15\">{{i.t}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #3D5873\">{{i.d}}</span>\n<span style=\"margin-top: auto; font-weight: 600; color: #0A6CC2; font-size: 15px\">{{i.cta}} →</span>\n</a>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- corridor brief -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px 90px\">\n<div style=\"background: #FFF8E6; border-radius: 32px; padding: 52px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 28px 56px; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 480px; min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #B45309; margin-bottom: 14px\">A SERIES · INDIA ↔ LATIN AMERICA</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(34px, 3.8vw, 54px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 16px\">The Corridor Brief</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #4A4030; margin: 0\">The fastest-growing trade lane most forwarders ignore. Routes, transit times, duties and opportunities between India and Brazil, Mexico, Chile, Peru, Colombia and beyond, written by people who have lived and worked on both sides.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 0 1 360px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/companies/?keywords=YAM%20Logistics\" style=\"background: #0A66C2; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 16px 24px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; text-align: center\">Follow on LinkedIn →</a>\n<a href=\"trade-desk.html\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF; color: #0B2A4A; padding: 16px 24px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #F3DFA6\">Read all Corridor Briefs</a>\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #7A6A48; text-align: center\">Also available in Español and Português</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- subscribe -->\n<div style=\"background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 28px 56px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.2vw, 60px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 12px\">Get the Trade Desk <span style=\"color: #FFC93C\">every Friday.</span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 17px; color: #DCEEFC; margin: 0\">The week's customs and route changes in one short email or WhatsApp. Unsubscribe any time.</p>\n</div>\n<sc-if value=\"{{subscribed}}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.14); border-radius: 20px; padding: 22px 26px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600\">✓ You're on the list. See you on Friday.</div>\n</sc-if>\n<sc-if value=\"{{notSubscribed}}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px\">\n<input type=\"email\" value=\"{{email}}\" onChange=\"{{setEmail}}\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" aria-label=\"Email address\" style=\"flex: 1 1 240px; min-width: 0; padding: 16px 20px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 16px; color: #0B2A4A\">\n<button onClick=\"{{subscribe}}\" style=\"background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 0 28px; min-height: 54px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit\">Subscribe</button>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/message/6YB7I76DV6UJL1\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; flex-basis: 100%\">or get it on WhatsApp →</a>\n</div>\n</sc-if>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n"}